liceType` value not bound. This makes it possible to use `texture_create_shared_from_slice` on an entire `Texture2DArray` for things like setting mipmaps for the entire array in a computer shader, which was only possible before by casting `3` to `TextureSliceType`, and I'm not sure if that is even possible outside of C++. This PR also adds support for multi-layer slicing to the `texture_create_shared_from_slice` wrapper binding, since the internal method already had support for it that wasn't exposed to ClassDB.\r\n\r\n## AI DISCLOSURE\r\nThe lack of a `TEXTURE_SLICE_2D_ARRAY` binding was found by Claude Code when debugging a separate project that needed to set mipmaps for all textures in a `Texture2DArray`. All code and documentation in this PR was written by me with no further AI involvement","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/follow